text = "each tv screen represents a settler.
click on it to open the settlers log page
if a screen is White the settler is not sick
if a screen is yellow the settler is sick and 
you should check their log
if a screen is black the settler is dead

to cure a settler os illness, open their log book and press
heal"

[node name="Label" type="Label" parent="CanvasLayer/TutorialPanel"]
